# {{project_name}}

Odoo {{version}} project

## Setup

1. Install Python dependencies:
   ```bash
   odx install
   ```

2. Start PostgreSQL:
   ```bash
   odx db start
   ```

3. Run Odoo:
   ```bash
   odx run
   ```

## Project Structure

- `custom_addons/` - Custom Odoo modules
- `external_addons/` - External Odoo modules (OCA, etc.)
- `.odx.toml` - Odoo version this project targets (the source itself is shared, see `odx store ls`)
- `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` - Briefing for AI agents working in this project
- `docs/` - Project documentation
- `scripts/` - Project-specific helper scripts (not used by odx CLI)

## Version Control

If you want to use Git:

```bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
```
